      "extract": "\\label{2-connections} Now we want to climb up one dimension, and talk about `2-connections'. A connection tells us how particles transform as they move along paths. A 2-connection will also tell us how \\emph{strings} transform as they sweep out \\emph{surfaces}. To make this idea precise, we need to take everything we said in the previous section and boost the dimension by one. Instead of categories, we need",
