      "extract": "\\label{string} The Lie 2-groups discussed so far are easy to construct. The string 2-group is considerably more subtle. Ultimately it forces upon us a deeper conception of what a Lie 2-group really is, and a more sophisticated approach to higher gauge theory. Treated in proper detail, these topics would carry us far beyond the limits of this quick introduction. But it would be a shame not to mention them at all.",
